<title>MALAYSIA: SAAG requests stock suspension.</title>
<headline>SAAG requests stock suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SAAG Corp said on Friday that it has requested a suspension in trading of its stock pending a company announcement.</p>
<p>A brief statement from the company did not provide any further details. Shares of SAAG Corp, a provider of services and equipment to the gas and petroleum industry last traded up 2.75 to 35.00 ringgit on Friday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange queried the company about a recent sharp increase in its stock price.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
